  "published": "2026-08-25T17:59:22.31Z",
  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds the PLATFORM_USERS module and permissions 118-120 so the TCM Admin panel can manage the people who operate the platform. PLATFORM_ASSIGN_ROLES is deliberately separate from PLATFORM_MANAGE_USERS: whoever can grant roles can grant their own, so inviting someone and turning them into a payments admin must not be the same attribution. Carries forward the 26.8.25.3 security fix - if you are on 26.8.25.1 or .2, upgrade: those placed the Platform_* values on 33-47, which RolePermission still uses with the pre-2026-04-23 meaning, handing PLATFORM_APPROVE_DISCOUNT to 19 roles across unrelated tenants. 33-102 are burned permanently; append above 120.",
